{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47265","headline":"游仙二十四首 二 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾凤栖瑶林，鵰鹗集平楚。\n饮啄本殊好，翺翔终异所。\n吾方遗諠嚣，立节慕高举。\n解兹区中恋，结彼霄外侣。\n谁谓天路遐，感通自无阻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}